// So Map 1's skirmishes are Common and its last match (an elite) holds its one Uncommon; Map 5's fights reach Rare; Map 10's Very Rare.
// 2026-10-24 (package BAL2, owner 10-23 22:23 #2: "For Map 5, the rare is the boss's leader. Normal skirmish rares only start coming in Map 10
// onwards (gently)"): on the MAIN road a normal skirmish holds Uncommon to Map 9, Rare from Map 10 and Very Rare from Map 15 (was Rare from 5,
// Very Rare from 10), so an elite reaches Rare on Maps 6-9 and Map 5's only Rare is its boss's (BAL2_FIRST_RARE_MAP: Map 5's elites stay
