    // draws, dnMarkSoundKey). Each starts SX_MARK_DELAY after the call, so the hit / element / skill cue that played with it reads first.
    // armour: a bright plate "ting" over a soft konk body (the 10-16 konk is folded in here; armorBadgeGlow only konks for old replays)
