  // Dark Points resource symbol (2026-09-20, per explicit request: "the dark point it gives...
  // should be a clear resource symbol on the card") -- ★ (a plain monochrome black-star glyph,
  // not a colored emoji) inherits whatever text color it's placed in rather than always looking
  // the same, and reads as a distinct "resource unit" icon unlike anything else on a card face.
  // Deliberately NOT ✦ (the four-pointed sparkle already used elsewhere for the empty-center
  // "play here" drop-zone invitation, see boardHTML/renderBoard) or ⭐/🌟 (the Forge's card-
  // leveling star-fall celebration) -- reusing either would make an unrelated existing icon mean
