  // (the mech-wrap tag, reference-tab title, Archetype dropdown) -- 😈 says "this card is
  // Devilry-themed," ★ says "this many Dark Points." Checks both the legacy top-level
  // onSpawnDevilry/onReadyDevilry fields (hand-authored data, mirroring Gold/Grace) and the
  // Custom Triggers array (the editor's own "Gain Dark Points" action, now the intended way to
