// Task list item 9 (2026-09-18, "change the gold symbol to a gold coin"): a small hand-drawn
// inline SVG coin (its gradient defined once in arena_template.html — see that comment for why
// a custom SVG rather than a second emoji) — used everywhere the Forge/out-of-game "Gold"
// currency's glyph is shown, in place of the money-bag emoji it used before.
// Renamed from coinIconHTML (2026-09-22, "confirm leaves" — the outer-game pack currency
// rename Jay specified earlier: "Replace Gold with Maple Leaves and Gems with Gold Leaves").
// Display-layer-only change, same low-risk approach used for Character->Bramble: the internal
// field name (myCurrencies.gold, SHOP_PACKS cost.gold, the 'bramblewood_arena_currencies'
// localStorage shape) stays exactly `gold` so nobody's saved progress breaks — only what's
// actually shown on screen changes. Also deliberately NOT touching in-match Gold (the 🪙 cost/
// wait/attack economy during a battle) at all -- that's a separate resource by design, see
