function currencyShown(k){ if(k === 'blossoms') return blossomsShown(); /* 2026-10-30 (ECON1): only once brambles can be reinforced, or some are held */ return !(k === 'kroon' && KROONI_RETIRED && !(typeof adminModeEnabled !== 'undefined' && adminModeEnabled)); }
/* ============================================================
   Achievements / collection milestones (task #253, "simple retention hooks — 'own 50 cards,'
   'win 10 matches'"). Deliberately built entirely on data that ALREADY exists and is already
   tracked elsewhere — loadMatchStats() (wins/best win streak, the same source
   renderPlayerStatsSubpage reads), getCardDefs()'s locked overlay (cards owned), myCardLevels
   (cards leveled up), and loadConquestProgress() (nodes/maps cleared, Raid Bosses unlocked) —
   rather than inventing a second, parallel progress-tracking system. The one genuinely new piece
   of state is which achievements have been CLAIMED (myClaimedAchievements below), since a
   threshold being met is re-derivable live every render but "already paid out" has to persist so
   a reward is never granted twice.
   Local-only for now, same known-gap precedent PRESTIGE_TIERS/myCardPrestige already set a
   comment up above: out of scope to wire into cloudPushCardLevels/cloudPullState this batch,
   additive and low-stakes to add later the same way. ============================================================ */
