// Prestige tiers (2026-09-23, batch #27, per explicit request: "beyond 10 is styling, e.g. gold,
// rainbow etc., extended art"). Strictly cosmetic — PRESTIGE_TIERS never touches attack/health,
// unlike myCardLevels above. Only reachable once a card is already at max level (10); tiers are
// bought in order (can't skip to Rainbow without owning Gold first) via the Forge, same spend-Dust-
// +-Gold flow as leveling. Stored separately from myCardLevels so a maxed-but-not-yet-prestiged
// card is a real, distinct state (prestigeTier 0). Known gap, flagged rather than silently
// skipped: unlike currencies/levels/unlocks, this is NOT wired into cloudPushCardLevels/
// cloudPullState yet — it's local-only this batch (device-bound, like the rest of this session's
