// Called after either half's selection changes (char-card click, leader drag-drop, leader clear)
// — replaces just the banner element in place. Guarded by the element existing at all since the
// banner only ever renders inside the deck-builder screen, not the (unused-today but still live)
// renderPlayerSubTab call sites, if any ever appear elsewhere in the future.
