// UX A12: always shows the current speed. 2026-10-10 (user): one arrow per step — ▶ 1×, ▶▶ 1.5×, ▶▶▶ 2×, ▶▶▶▶ 3×.
// Playback speeds open as you progress (2026-10-12, user: "1.5x after your first Skirmish. 2x after your first elite (end of
