  Object.keys(frInv).forEach(id=>{ let k = frInv[id]|0; while(k > 0){ const c = creditFreePack(id); if(!c) break; k--; n++; c.o.results.forEach(r=> names.push(r.id)); } frInv[id] = Math.max(0, k); });
  saveFreePacks(frInv);
